## Rewards
The rewards are the following:
- First place gets: a rare Tofufu egg, a legendary box and 12% of the cash prize.
- Second, third and fourth places get: a Tofufu egg, an epic box and 6% of the cash prize each.
- 5th to 8th place get: a rare box and 3.75% of the cash prize each.
- 9th to 16th places get: a rare box and 1.875% of the cash prize each.
- Those with only with one win get: 0.75% of the cash prize each.
- The others qualified get: 0.25% of the cash prize.
# Rewards for Qualifiers
Do not forget there are rewards for reaching 500, 750, 1000, 1200, 1300 and 1400 points during qualifications!

Happy tournament to all!
